"phrases": [
[
0.25,
3.305,
"Ever feel like the whole world is spinning out of control?"
],
[
3.895,
5.911,
"Psalm 2 opens right there."
],
[
6.349,
7.508,
"Nations raging."
],
[
7.925,
11.365,
"Rulers plotting to break free from God and his chosen King."
],
[
11.916,
14.013,
"The New Testament tells us David wrote it."
],
[
14.539,
14.994,
"And heaven?"
],
[
15.473,
16.276,
"God isn't worried."
],
[
16.612,
17.314,
"He laughs."
],
[
17.79,
18.769,
"Then he speaks:"
],
[
19.18,
21.675,
"\"I have set my King on my holy hill.\""
],
[
22.276,
22.951,
"Here's the key."
],
[
23.393,
24.936,
"The word for God's \"Anointed\""
],
[
25.126,
26.642,
"is the Hebrew mashiach."
],
[
27.062,
27.654,
"Messiah."
],
[
28.127,
28.631,
"In Greek,"
],
[
28.821,
29.7,
"that's Christos."
],
[
30.035,
30.536,
"Christ."
],
[
30.966,
33.569,
"And when God tells his King, \"You are my Son,\""
],
[
33.95,
36.953,
"the New Testament applies those very words to Jesus."
],
[
37.467,
38.725,
"So the chaos is real,"
],
[
39.077,
40.389,
"but it isn't in charge."
],
[
40.791,
43.192,
"And the psalm ends the way Psalm 1 began,"
],
[
43.522,
44.1,
"with the word"
],
[
44.389,
44.84,
"\"blessed.\""
],
[
45.239,
47.788,
"Blessed are all who take refuge in him."
],
[
48.375,
50.097,
"Next time the news feels loud,"
],
[
50.516,
51.397,
"take it to the King."
],
[
51.877,
52.937,
"The world rages."
],
[
